' 4+1 process view - Owner notices and reminders (US21, US23, US29) · read at send time; skipped when they no longer apply
' Version 1.1 - 2026-11-10
' For: whoever writes code and whoever debugs.
' Documented decision: Notices and reminders are read at send time and skipped (skipped_at) when they no longer apply (US21, US23, US29).
' Not drawn: internal detail of the classes; refusals that do not change the sequence (they are in the text of process.md).
@startuml process-outbox-skip
!include ../style.puml

title Process view - owner notices and reminders (US21, US23, US29): read at send time; skipped when they no longer apply
autonumber

box "Outbox worker (in the API process)"
  participant "Process" as API_NOTIF_PROC
  participant "AccountEmailBuilder" as API_AUTH_RESET
  participant "Compose" as API_NOTIF_COMPOSE
  participant "Send" as API_NOTIF_SENDER
end box
database "PostgreSQL" as C_DB

note over API_NOTIF_PROC, C_DB: Before: the booking put booking_reminder (due at startsAt − 3 h) and\nowner_new_booking in the outbox, with BookingRefPayload { bookingId } only.\nAfterwards, the player cancelled, or the admin deactivated the club's owner.

API_NOTIF_PROC -> C_DB : Reads the booking with the pitch and the club, now [SELECT bookings JOIN\npitches JOIN clubs]
alt booking gone or a customer's (no player_id)
  API_NOTIF_PROC -> API_NOTIF_PROC : GiveUp(recipient_not_found)
else booking_reminder and status ≠ Confirmed
  API_NOTIF_PROC -> C_DB : Skip(booking_not_confirmed): skipped_at, not sent, no\nattempt counted [UPDATE outbox_messages]
else booking_reminder and startsAt ≤ now (the worker was stopped)
  API_NOTIF_PROC -> C_DB : Skip(booking_started) [UPDATE outbox_messages]
else
  API_NOTIF_PROC -> C_DB : The player and the recipient (the player, or the club's owner)\n[SELECT users]
  alt owner_new_booking
    API_NOTIF_PROC -> API_AUTH_RESET : IsActiveAsync(ownerId)
    alt owner deactivated
      API_NOTIF_PROC -> C_DB : Skip(owner_deactivated) [UPDATE outbox_messages]
    end
  end
  API_NOTIF_PROC -> API_NOTIF_COMPOSE : Reminder(details, name) or OwnerNewBooking(details, name)
  API_NOTIF_PROC -> API_NOTIF_SENDER : SendAsync(email) and MarkSent, or RecordFailure (previous\ndiagram)
end
@enduml
